So we want everybody
to try it out,

00:25:13.870 --> 00:25:16.840
see what appeals to them
most-- maybe it's something we

00:25:16.840 --> 00:25:17.770
didn't think of--

00:25:17.770 --> 00:25:19.180
and let us know how that works.

00:25:19.180 --> 00:25:21.970
What did you try to do
